<!doctype html>
<html lang="ms">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="description" content="Rekod dan kira tuntutan elaun lebih masa bulanan berdasarkan templat Jun.xls."><title>Rekod OT · Tuntutan bulanan</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"><link rel="icon" href="favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"></head>
<body><a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Langkau ke kandungan</a>
<aside class="sidebar no-print"><a class="brand" href="./"><span class="brandmark">ot.</span><span>Rekod OT<small>Tuntutan bulanan</small></span></a><div class="navlabel">RUANG KERJA</div><button class="nav active" aria-current="page" data-view="records"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="3" width="16" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M8 8h8M8 12h8M8 16h5"/></svg><span>Rekod tuntutan</span></button><button class="nav" data-view="profile"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3"/><path d="M5 21v-2a7 7 0 0 1 14 0v2"/></svg><span>Maklumat pegawai</span></button><button class="nav" data-view="calculation"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2"/><path d="M8 6h8M8 11h1m6 0h1m-8 4h1m6 0h1m-8 4h1m6 0h1"/></svg><span>Perincian kiraan</span></button><div class="sidebottom"><span class="dot"></span> Simpanan komputer ini<p>Berdasarkan templat Jun.xls<br>Pejabat SUK Pahang</p></div></aside>
<main id="main-content" tabindex="-1"><header class="topbar no-print"><a href="./" class="home-link" aria-label="Kembali ke laman utama">Laman utama</a><span>SUK PAHANG <span class="separator">/</span> ELAUN LEBIH MASA</span><span id="save-status" role="status">Memuatkan rekod…</span></header>
<div class="workspace"><div class="pagehead no-print"><div><div class="eyebrow">TUNTUTAN BULANAN</div><h1 id="page-title">Rekod lebih masa</h1><p class="subtitle">Urus jam bekerja dan tuntutan bulanan, semuanya di satu tempat.</p></div><div class="actions"><button id="print" class="button"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 9V3h12v6M6 18H4V9h16v9h-2"/><path d="M6 14h12v7H6zM17 11h.01"/></svg>Cetak / PDF</button><button id="save" class="button primary"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 3h12l4 4v14H3V3zM7 3v6h10V3M7 21v-8h10v8"/></svg><span>Simpan tuntutan</span></button></div></div>
<div id="notice" class="notice no-print" role="alert" hidden></div>
<div class="periodbar no-print"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 7V4h6l3 3h9v13H3z"/></svg><label for="month">Bulan tuntutan <input id="month" type="month" required></label><span id="record-count">0 rekod</span><div class="periodright"><label for="saved-month">Buka simpanan</label><select id="saved-month"><option value="">Pilih bulan</option></select></div></div>
<section class="summary no-print" aria-label="Ringkasan tuntutan"><div><span>Jumlah tuntutan</span><strong id="total">RM 0.00</strong><small id="rate-note">Isi gaji pokok untuk mengira kadar</small></div><div><span>Jam layak dituntut</span><strong id="hours">0 <small>jam</small></strong><small id="gross-note">0 jam kerja · 0 jam potongan</small></div><div class="summary-last"><span>Asas pengiraan</span><p>6 kategori lebih masa</p><button class="textbutton" data-view="calculation">Lihat pecahan kadar <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button></div></section>
<div id="limit-notice" class="notice no-print" role="status" hidden></div><div id="salary-prompt" class="setup-strip no-print" hidden><div><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3"/><path d="M5 21v-2a7 7 0 0 1 14 0v2"/></svg><span><strong>Lengkapkan gaji pokok dahulu</strong><small>Kadar sejam dan amaun tuntutan akan dikira secara automatik.</small></span></div><button class="button" data-view="profile">Isi maklumat pegawai <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button></div><section id="records-view" class="view no-print"><div class="sectionhead"><div><h2>Senarai kerja lebih masa</h2><p id="month-label"></p></div><button id="add" class="button primary"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg>Tambah rekod</button></div>
<form id="entry-form" class="editor" novalidate hidden><div class="editorhead"><h3 id="editor-title">Tambah rekod OT</h3><button type="button" id="close-editor" class="textbutton">Tutup</button></div><div class="formgrid"><label>Tarikh<input name="date" type="date" required aria-describedby="entry-month-hint"><small id="entry-month-hint"></small></label><label>Jenis hari<select name="type"><option value="work">Hari kerja biasa</option><option value="rest">Hari rehat biasa</option><option value="holiday">Hari kelepasan am</option></select></label><label>Kategori masa<select name="band"><option value="Day">Siang</option><option value="Night">Malam</option></select></label><label>Cara masukkan masa<select name="mode"><option value="hours">Isi jumlah jam</option><option value="time">Waktu mula & tamat</option></select></label><label id="hours-field">Jumlah jam<input name="hours" type="number" min="0.01" max="24" step="any" value="1"></label><label class="time-field" hidden>Mula<input name="start" type="time" value="18:00"></label><label class="time-field" hidden>Tamat<input name="end" type="time" value="19:00"></label><label>Tolak masa (jam)<input name="deduction" type="number" min="0" max="24" step="any" value="0"><small>Contoh: 0.5 untuk 30 minit rehat</small></label><label class="checklabel time-field" hidden><input name="overnight" type="checkbox">Tamat pada hari berikutnya</label><label class="wide task-field">Keterangan tugas<textarea name="description" maxlength="500" rows="2" placeholder="Contoh: Penyelenggaraan sistem jabatan" required></textarea></label></div><p class="hint">Pilih kategori mengikut tugas sebenar. Pecahkan sesi kepada baris berasingan jika bertukar siang/malam atau jenis hari.</p><div id="entry-error" class="notice" tabindex="-1" role="alert" hidden></div><div class="editorfoot"><span id="entry-preview" aria-live="polite"></span><button class="button primary" type="submit">Masukkan rekod</button></div></form>
<div class="tablewrap"><table class="records"><thead><tr><th>Tarikh / Hari</th><th>Tugas & kategori</th><th>Waktu</th><th class="numeric">Jam kerja</th><th class="numeric">Potongan</th><th class="numeric">Jam OT</th><th><span class="sr-only">Tindakan</span></th></tr></thead><tbody id="entries"></tbody><tfoot id="table-foot"></tfoot></table><div id="empty" class="empty"><div class="empty-symbol"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="3" width="16" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M8 8h8M8 12h8M8 16h5"/></svg></div><h3>Mulakan rekod bulan ini</h3><p>Tambah tarikh, tugas dan jam lebih masa.<br>Kiraan tuntutan akan dikemas kini secara automatik.</p><button id="empty-add" class="button">Tambah rekod pertama</button></div></div><p class="footnote">Jam perpuluhan: 0.25 = 15 minit, 0.5 = 30 minit, 0.75 = 45 minit.</p></section>
<section id="profile-view" class="view no-print" hidden><div class="sectionhead"><div><h2>Maklumat pegawai & kadar</h2><p>Disimpan bersama tuntutan bulan yang dipilih.</p></div></div><form id="profile-form" class="profile"><fieldset><legend><span>01</span> Butiran pegawai</legend><p>Maklumat ini digunakan pada borang cetakan tuntutan.</p><div class="formgrid"><label>Nama penuh<input name="name" maxlength="150"></label><label>No. kad pengenalan<input name="identity" maxlength="30"></label><label>Jawatan / Gred<input name="position" maxlength="150"></label><label>No. gaji<input name="payroll" maxlength="50"></label><label class="wide">Jabatan<input name="department" maxlength="250"></label><label>No. akaun bank<input name="bank" maxlength="100"></label></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend><span>02</span> Gaji & kadar sejam</legend><p>Masukkan gaji pokok. Sistem mengira kadar asas mengikut formula templat.</p><div class="formgrid"><label>Gaji pokok (RM)<input name="salary" type="number" min="0" step="0.01"><small>Kadar sejam dikira automatik selepas gaji dimasukkan.</small></label><input name="rateMode" type="hidden" value="salary"><label>Kadar sejam automatik (RM)<input name="rate" type="number" step="any" value="0.00" readonly aria-describedby="rate-formula"><small id="rate-formula">Gaji pokok × 12 ÷ (313 × 8)</small></label></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend><span>03</span> Maklumat pekerjaan</legend><div class="formgrid"><label>Waktu kerja biasa<input name="normalHours" maxlength="100"></label><label>Hari rehat<input name="restDays" maxlength="100"></label><label>Tuntutan elaun perjalanan<select name="travel"><option value="none">Tidak ada</option><option value="yes">Ada (sertakan penyata)</option></select></label></div></fieldset></form><div class="explanation"><h3>Bagaimana kadar dikira?</h3><p>Kadar daripada gaji = gaji pokok × 12 ÷ (313 × 8). Kadar dikemas kini setiap kali gaji pokok berubah. Pengiraan mengekalkan ketepatan penuh; wang dipaparkan kepada dua perpuluhan.</p><p>Maklumat bulan terdahulu tidak berubah apabila kau mengemas kini bulan ini.</p></div></section>
<section id="calculation-view" class="view no-print" hidden><div class="sectionhead"><div><h2>Perincian kiraan</h2><p>Jumlah jam kategori × pengganda × kadar asas sejam.</p></div></div><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Kategori OT</th><th class="numeric">Jam</th><th class="numeric">Pengganda</th><th class="numeric">Kadar asas</th><th class="numeric">Amaun</th></tr></thead><tbody id="breakdown"></tbody><tfoot><tr><th colspan="4">Jumlah tuntutan</th><td class="numeric" id="breakdown-total"></td></tr></tfoot></table></div><div class="explanation"><h3>Berpandukan fail kau</h3><p>Enam pengganda dan formula jumlah mengikut Jun.xls. Sistem memautkan jumlah jam kepada kiraan bayaran secara automatik. Masa rehat, kategori siang/malam dan hari kelepasan am ditentukan oleh pengguna.</p><p>Tiada pembundaran pada setiap kategori dalam formula asal. Jumlah akhir dikira daripada nilai penuh, jadi jumlah amaun yang dipaparkan mungkin berbeza satu sen.</p></div></section>
<footer class="workspace-footer no-print"><span>Rekod OT <span class="separator">/</span> SUK Pahang</span><button id="backup" class="textbutton"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3v12m-5-5 5 5 5-5M4 16v5h16v-5"/></svg>Muat turun sandaran</button><button type="button" id="restore-button" class="textbutton"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 16V4m-5 5 5-5 5 5M4 16v5h16v-5"/></svg>Pulihkan sandaran</button><input id="restore" type="file" accept="application/json,.json" aria-label="Fail sandaran tuntutan" hidden></footer>
<section id="print-document" class="print-only"></section>
</div></main><script type="module" src="app.mjs"></script></body></html>
